# Straight up the vert ramp, press I at the coping (no speed along it): Rock to Fakie stall,
# hold I about half a second, let go: drop back in and land fakie. 10 m/s from the spawn reaches
# the coping with about 4 m/s up (drag and rolling resistance take the rest; 9 m/s barely gets there).
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
hold grind 212..278
bot balance
run 600
expect event lipStart{trick=Rock to Fakie} within 210..220
expect event lipEnd{trick=Rock to Fakie,reason=drop in} within 276..282
expect event land{fakie=true} within 280..360
expect event comboLanded{name=Rock to Fakie} within 280..380
expect no event bail
expect no event danger
